**corollary 14.3 (ROC3 stabilization).** The p-primary parts of P_(p^a) stabilize to a cyclic group of order p^(h_p-1). This assertion concerns the nonmaximal orders O_(p^a) in K; it makes no claim about the full class group of the different field K(zeta_p).

**Proof.** The prime-to-p factor is M_p, and min(a-1,h_p-1) becomes constant at a=h_p.

